{"cell_type":"In","gene_id":"ENSG00000250067","module":"turquoise","kme":0.184415,"hub":false,"module_direction":"lower in AD","module_padj":0.446504,"module_significant":false}],"degas_bulk_de":false,"drug_target":false}},"description":[{"gene_id":"ENSG00000250067","entrez_id":["374887"],"uniprot":["A6XGL0"],"ncbi_summary":"Predicted to enable NADHX epimerase activity. Predicted to be involved in several processes, including hematopoietic stem cell proliferation; membrane raft distribution; and negative regulation of angiogenesis. Predicted to be active in mitochondrion. [provided by Alliance of Genome Resources, Apr 2022]","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"A6XGL0","text":"May accelerate cholesterol efflux from endothelial cells to high-density lipoprotein (HDL) and thereby regulates angiogenesis. May orchestrate hematopoietic stem and progenitor cell emergence from the hemogenic endothelium, a type of specialized endothelium manifesting hematopoietic potential. YJEFN3-mediated cholesterol efflux activates endothelial SREBF2, the master transcription factor for cholesterol biosynthesis, which in turn transactivates NOTCH and promotes hematopoietic stem and progenitor cell emergence (By similarity). May play a role in spermiogenesis and oogenesis (PubMed:17533573)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}